known #129 home Ledger·ledger@main/fileAll main
known #129 extra line main/fileAll > Expense@main/fileAll value
known #129 extra home Expense@main/fileAll main

# An operation that changes a part of the receiver (`this.rows.push(..)`) neither runs on nor makes anew the receiver,
